--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- NAME: Overcoming Procrastination Workshop Sign-up
-- The workshop was held on Nov 24, 2026. Since Nov 25 this page says so and only takes sign-ups for
-- accountability partners (the workshop registration version is in git history, guidedtrack/).
-- Embedded at programs.clearerthinking.org/procrastination-workshop-with-spencer-greenberg/ ;
-- clearerthinking.org/procrastination-workshop redirects there.
--
-- DATA: filter the export on accountabilityOptIn = 1 and match within partnerGender (man/woman).
-- signupPhase = "after" marks post-workshop sign-ups (not workshop registrants; blank before Nov 25).
-- Someone who registered earlier without a partner signs up again here, so dedupe by signupEmail
-- and keep the LATEST row. src=qa rows are tests.
-- Intros go out on the first weekday of Dec (Dec 1), Jan and Feb, a new partner each time.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

*if: not src
	>> src = ""

>> emailLooksWrong = 0

*settings
	*menu: no
	*back: no

*label: signupForm

*page
	*html
		<style>
			.program_container .main { max-width: 640px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 96px; }
			@media (max-width: 767px) { .program_container .main { padding-top: 64px; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; } }
			.program_container p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2a2a2a; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 14px 0; }
			.program_container a { color: #0A6FD6; text-decoration: underline; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }
			.program_container .btn { background-color: #0885F8; border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
			.program_container .btn:hover, .program_container .btn:focus { background-color: #0A6FD6; border: none; color: #fff; }
			.program_container .btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #0A6FD6; outline-offset: 3px; }
			@media (min-width: 600px) { .program_container .btn.btn-block { display: inline-block; width: auto; min-width: 300px; } }
			.program_container .ct-brandrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0 0 22px 0; }
			.program_container .ct-logo { display: inline-block; width: 30px; height: 30px; background-image: url("https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,onerror=redirect/uploads/publication/logo/d0ed5a5f-0bca-4054-ab2c-73fd51707f71/Logo-01.png"); background-size: contain; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center; }
			.program_container .ct-wordmark { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
			.program_container:has(#ct-logo) .ct-brandrow { display: none; }
			.program_container h1.ct-title { color: #1a1a1a !important; font-size: 30px !important; line-height: 1.2 !important; font-weight: 700 !important; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 10px 0 !important; }
			@media (max-width: 480px) { .program_container h1.ct-title { font-size: 28px !important; } }
			.program_container .prompt { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1a1a; }
			.program_container .tip { color: #6b7380; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; }
			.program_container .form-control { border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cfd6e0; padding: 12px 14px; height: auto; font-size: 17px; box-shadow: none; }
			.program_container .form-control:focus { border-color: #0885F8; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(8,133,248,0.22); outline: none; }
			.program_container li.answer { border: 1px solid #dfe6f0; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
			.program_container li.answer:hover, .program_container li.answer:focus-within { border-color: #0885F8; }
			.program_container .ct-warn { border: 1px solid #f3c98b !important; border-radius: 10px !important; box-shadow: none !important; background: #fff7ea !important; padding: 12px 16px !important; margin: 0 0 18px 0 !important; }
			.program_container .ct-warn p { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #6b4a12; }
		</style>

	*html
		<div class="ct-brandrow"><span class="ct-logo"></span><span class="ct-wordmark">Clearer Thinking</span></div>
		<h1 class="ct-title">This workshop has ended, but you can still get an accountability partner</h1>
		<p>Thanks for your interest in Overcoming Procrastination with Spencer Greenberg. It took place on November 24. We're emailing the recording to everyone who registered.</p>
		<p><b>What you can still join:</b> on the first weekday of December, January and February, we'll introduce you by email to a new partner who is also working on a project. Men are paired with men, and women with women. After that, it's up to the two of you. There's no obligation.</p>
		<p>The first introductions go out on Tuesday, December 1. If you sign up after that, you'll be included in the ones that remain.</p>

	*if: emailLooksWrong = 1
		*component
			*classes: ct-warn
			*html
				<p>That email address doesn't look complete (it needs an @ and a dot after it). Please check it and try again.</p>

	*question: Email address
		*type: text
		*placeholder: you@example.com
		*tip: The only thing we share with your partner is this address, so feel free to use any one you like. You can opt out at any time, no explanation needed. And if anyone ever makes you uncomfortable, stop replying and let us know: we'll remove them from future pairings.
		*save: signupEmail

	*question: I am a...
		*tip: We pair men with men and women with women.
		*save: partnerGenderAnswer
		Man
		Woman

	*question: What's one project you keep putting off? (optional)
		*type: paragraph
		*blank
		*placeholder: e.g., Finishing my portfolio, starting a newsletter, my thesis
		*tip: We'll use it only to pair you with someone likely to be a good fit. We won't show it to them.
		*save: projectToWorkOn

	*button: Get an accountability partner

-- Light check that the address can receive mail: exactly one @ with text on both sides, no
-- spaces, and a dot inside the DOMAIN with at least two characters after it. The dot is looked
-- for in the domain alone because text.find only returns the FIRST match (first.last@... is valid).
>> signupEmail = signupEmail.clean
>> emailLooksWrong = 0
>> atPosition = signupEmail.find("@")
>> spacePosition = signupEmail.find(" ")
*if: not atPosition
	>> emailLooksWrong = 1
*if: spacePosition
	>> emailLooksWrong = 1
*if: atPosition
	*if: atPosition < 2
		>> emailLooksWrong = 1
	*if: atPosition > 1
		>> emailParts = signupEmail.split("@")
		>> emailPartCount = emailParts.size
		*if: not (emailPartCount = 2)
			>> emailLooksWrong = 1
		*if: emailPartCount = 2
			>> emailDomain = emailParts[2]
			>> domainDot = emailDomain.find(".")
			>> domainSize = emailDomain.size
			*if: not domainDot
				>> emailLooksWrong = 1
			*if: domainDot
				*if: domainDot < 2
					>> emailLooksWrong = 1
				*if: domainDot > domainSize - 2
					>> emailLooksWrong = 1
*if: emailLooksWrong = 1
	*goto: signupForm

>> signedUpAt = calendar::now
>> signupPhase = "after"
>> accountabilityOptIn = 1
>> partnerGender = ""
*if: partnerGenderAnswer = "Man"
	>> partnerGender = "man"
*if: partnerGenderAnswer = "Woman"
	>> partnerGender = "woman"

*email
	*to: {signupEmail}
	*subject: You're signed up for an accountability partner
	*body
		Hi,

		You're signed up for an accountability partner.

		On the first weekday of December, January and February, we'll introduce you by email to a new partner (men are paired with men, women with women). The first introductions go out on Tuesday, December 1. If you signed up after that, you'll be included in the ones that remain.

		Each email comes with a few conversation starters and tips. We only make the introduction, and the rest is up to the two of you. There's no obligation.

		If you change your mind, reply to this email and we'll take you off the list.

		Igor Scaldini
		Clearer Thinking

*html
	<style>
		.program_container .main { max-width: 640px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 96px; }
		@media (max-width: 767px) { .program_container .main { padding-top: 64px; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; } }
		.program_container p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2a2a2a; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 14px 0; }
		.program_container a { color: #0A6FD6; text-decoration: underline; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }
		.program_container .btn { background-color: #0885F8; border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
		.program_container .ct-brandrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0 0 22px 0; }
		.program_container .ct-logo { display: inline-block; width: 30px; height: 30px; background-image: url("https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,onerror=redirect/uploads/publication/logo/d0ed5a5f-0bca-4054-ab2c-73fd51707f71/Logo-01.png"); background-size: contain; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center; }
		.program_container .ct-wordmark { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
		.program_container:has(#ct-logo) .ct-brandrow { display: none; }
		.program_container h1.ct-title { color: #1a1a1a !important; font-size: 30px !important; line-height: 1.2 !important; font-weight: 700 !important; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 10px 0 !important; }
		.program_container h2.ct-h2 { color: #1a1a1a !important; font-size: 21px !important; line-height: 1.3 !important; font-weight: 700 !important; margin: 40px 0 10px 0 !important; }
		.program_container .ct-facts { border: 1px solid #dfe6f0 !important; border-radius: 10px !important; box-shadow: none !important; background: #f4f8fd !important; padding: 16px 20px !important; margin: 0 0 24px 0 !important; }
		.program_container .ct-facts p { margin: 3px 0; font-size: 16px; }
		.program_container .ct-facts b { color: #1a1a1a; }
		.program_container ul.ct-list { padding-left: 22px; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
		.program_container ul.ct-list li { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2a2a2a; margin-bottom: 10px; }
		.program_container ul.ct-list li b { color: #1a1a1a; }
		@media (max-width: 480px) { .program_container h1.ct-title { font-size: 28px !important; } }
		.program_container p.ct-fine { color: #6b7380; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 28px 0 0 0; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #e6eaf0; }
		.program_container p.ct-share { margin: 4px 0 14px 0; }
		.program_container p.ct-share a { display: inline-block; max-width: 100%; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid #dfe6f0; border-radius: 8px; background: #f4f8fd; color: #0A6FD6; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4; text-decoration: none; word-break: break-all; }
	</style>

*html
	<div class="ct-brandrow"><span class="ct-logo"></span><span class="ct-wordmark">Clearer Thinking</span></div>
	<h1 class="ct-title">You're signed up.</h1>
	<p>We'll introduce you to your partners by email, at {signupEmail}. The first introductions go out on Tuesday, December 1.</p>
	<p>A confirmation is on its way. If it isn't there in a few minutes, check your spam folder and mark it as not spam, so the introductions don't end up there too.</p>
	<p>You can close this page.</p>
